        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, humanity has rebelled, and your task is to tear apart a way out of the rebellion······</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Rift is a single player survivor-like space rougelike game, in which you can choose your spaceship and customize your weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0400dc851d9f99ecfa3bee08620f1a41.poster.avif?t=1760336359\" aria-label=\"11451\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0400dc851d9f99ecfa3bee08620f1a41.webm?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0400dc851d9f99ecfa3bee08620f1a41.mp4?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can approach the box to pick up items and press N to assemble it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the organization will assign you random upgrades. In the game, you need to press the space bar to level up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/86ea6b162a3732732e8bfdc20e2220d7.poster.avif?t=1760336359\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/86ea6b162a3732732e8bfdc20e2220d7.webm?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/86ea6b162a3732732e8bfdc20e2220d7.mp4?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting the game, you can choose your spaceship route. There are five options for ship lines, each with eight levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Basic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Disk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Raid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Engineering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Slicing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship line has different weapon slot layouts and capabilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0cc796f65b9fb0f85cc013e4262496ba.avif?t=1760336359\" width=1411 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, you can use the minerals you obtained in the last game to upgrade your spaceship before starting the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's it, tear apart the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, humanity has rebelled, and your task is to tear apart a way out of the rebellion······</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Rift is a single player survivor-like space rougelike game, in which you can choose your spaceship and customize your weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0400dc851d9f99ecfa3bee08620f1a41.poster.avif?t=1760336359\" aria-label=\"11451\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0400dc851d9f99ecfa3bee08620f1a41.webm?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0400dc851d9f99ecfa3bee08620f1a41.mp4?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can approach the box to pick up items and press N to assemble it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the organization will assign you random upgrades. In the game, you need to press the space bar to level up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/86ea6b162a3732732e8bfdc20e2220d7.poster.avif?t=1760336359\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/86ea6b162a3732732e8bfdc20e2220d7.webm?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/86ea6b162a3732732e8bfdc20e2220d7.mp4?t=1760336359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before starting the game, you can choose your spaceship route. There are five options for ship lines, each with eight levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Basic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Disk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Raid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Engineering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Slicing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship line has different weapon slot layouts and capabilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041620/extras/0cc796f65b9fb0f85cc013e4262496ba.avif?t=1760336359\" width=1411 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, you can use the minerals you obtained in the last game to upgrade your spaceship before starting the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's it, tear apart the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
